      "16": {
        "name": "ACC_ODR_FILTER_PARAM",
        "access": "RW",
        "width": 1,
        "description": "加速度计 ODR 和滤波器参数寄存器",
        "roles": [
          "accel_config",
          "odr_config",
          "filter_config"
        ],
        "fields": [
          {
            "name": "filter_param",
            "bits": "7:5",
            "description": "滤波器参数，含义由 0x0F.bit6 选择\n低通模式（0x0F.bit6=0）：000 = LPF 关闭；100 = IIR 1；*01 = IIR 2；*10 = IIR 4；*11 = IIR 8\n高通模式（0x0F.bit6=1）：000 = HPF 关闭；001 = CF=ODR/10；010 = CF=ODR/25；011 = CF=ODR/50；100 = CF=ODR/100；101 = CF=ODR/200；110 = CF=ODR/400；111 = CF=ODR/800",
            "roles": [

            ],
            "event": null,
            "ignore_by_default": false
          },
          {
            "name": "odr",
            "bits": "4:0",
            "description": "加速度计输出数据率选择；应用笔记表中以 ** 表示 bit[4:3] 不影响该行 ODR\n**000 = MCLK 51.2/102.4/25.6/12.8/6.4kHz 时 ODR 为 100/200/50/25/12.5Hz\n**001 = 200/400/100/50/25Hz\n**010 = 400/800/200/100/50Hz\n**011 = 800/1600/400/200/100Hz\n**100 = 1600/3200/800/400/200Hz\n**101 = 50/100/25/12.5/6.25Hz\n**110 = 25/50/12.5/6.25/3.125Hz\n**111 = 12.5/25/6.25/3.125/1.56Hz\n非 51.2kHz MCLK 下的 ODR 为理想值，实际 ODR 与实际 MCLK 成正比：Real_ODR = ODR_51.2kHz * (Real_MCLK / 51.2kHz)",
            "roles": [

            ],
            "event": null,
            "ignore_by_default": false
          }
        ]
      },
      "17": {
        "name": "MCLK_CFG",
        "access": "RW",
